y-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Crumbs in my bralette.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/95/Crumbs_in_my_bralette..png/revision/latest?cb=20221024142505\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Crumbs in my bralette.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/95/Crumbs_in_my_bralette..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221024142505\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/95/Crumbs_in_my_bralette..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20221024142505 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/9/95/Crumbs_in_my_bralette..png/revision/latest?cb=20221024142505 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Crumbs in my bralette.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Crumbs_in_my_bralette..png\" data-image-name=\"Crumbs in my bralette..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">14</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\">Sarah Millican</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dafty_in_the_middle.\" title=\"Dafty in the middle.\">Dafty in the middle.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chip_Biffington.\" title=\"Chip Biffington.\">Chip Biffington.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Crumbs in my bralette.</b></i> is the fourth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_14\" title=\"Series 14\">Series 14</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 20 October 2022. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\">Sarah Millican</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Crumbs_in_my_bralette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Crumbs in my bralette\" was one of the lyrics from <a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\">Sarah Millican</a>'s song in the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_a_classic_song\" title=\"Write a classic song\">Write a classic song</a> task. The title card is of a lot of bubbles, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Turn_on_the_bubble_machine\" title=\"Turn on the bubble machine\">Turn on the bubble machine</a> task. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Crumbs_in_my_bralette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Krummer i min bralette', which translates as 'Crumbs in my bralette'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Murusia rintsikoissa', which translates as 'Crumbs in the bra'.</li>\n<li>On Sweden's SVT Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Satsuman i curryn', which translates as 'The satsuma in the curry'. This is a reference to <a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\">John Kearns</a>' attempt at the <a href=\"/wiki/Write_a_classic_song\" title=\"Write a classic song\">Write a classic song</a> task.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Smuler i bh-en uten bøyle', which translates as 'Crumbs in the wireless bra'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Crumbs_in_my_bralette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Dara_%C3%93_Briain\" title=\"Dara Ó Briain\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Dara Ó Briain</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Fern_Brady\" title=\"Fern Brady\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Fern Brady</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/John_Kearns\" title=\"John Kearns\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">John Kearns</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Munya_Chawawa\" title=\"Munya Chawawa\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Munya Chawawa</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Sarah_Millican\" title=\"Sarah Millican\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Sarah Millican</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Greatest_addition_to_a_garden\" title=\"Greatest addition to a garden\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Greatest addition to a garden.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Turn_on_the_bubble_machine\" title=\"Turn on the bubble machine\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Turn on the bubble machine. You may not step off or move the doormat.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Get_this_tarpaulin_completely_in_one_of_the_containers\" title=\"Get this tarpaulin completely in one of the containers\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Get this tarpaulin completely in one of the containers. You have a maximum of five minutes and you must select your container before you touch the tarpaulin. Also, you must tidy everything up within those five minutes.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Write_a_classic_song\" title=\"Write a classic song\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Write down five wonderful words.\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">4\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\">2\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td>Write a classic song. You must write lyrics for a piece of classical music. Your lyrics must contain your five wonderful words.\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Throw_your_egg_and_your_spoon_the_same_distance\" title=\"Throw your egg and your spoon the same distance\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Live:</b> Throw your egg and your spoon the same distance. Both egg and spoon must cross the qualifying line. If either your egg or your spoon fall off the Knappett, you are disqualified. The most distanced egg and spoon each round are out. If your egg doesn't break, your distance is halved.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>19\n</td>\n<td>15\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">22\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Crumbs_in_my_bralette.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/crumbs-my-bralette\"><i>Crumbs in my bralette.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/70915-004\"><i>Crumbs in my bralette.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141517\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.060 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.123 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 774/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 26042/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 174/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800547/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   67.704      1 -total\n 52.66%   35.651      1 Template:Spoilers\n 50.34%   34.080      1 Template:MessageBox\n 25.74%   17.425      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 15.64%   10.589      1 Template:Episodes\n  8.30%    5.622     10 Template:Link\n  2.97%    2.010      1 Template:Clear\n  2.71%    1.837      1 Template:Chronology\n  2.39%    1.618      5 Template:Color\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:3232-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920141517 and revision id 43826. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}